ta-item\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; color: #666; font-size: 0.85rem;\">\r\n                            <i class=\"far fa-user\" style=\"color: #ff5722;\"></i>\r\n                            <span>Sarah Johnson</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"meta-item\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; color: #666; font-size: 0.85rem;\">\r\n                            <i class=\"far fa-comment\" style=\"color: #ff5722;\"></i>\r\n                            <span>36 commentaires</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    \r\n                    <h3 class=\"card-title\" style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #1a365d; line-height: 1.4;\">\r\n                        New York insolite : Les quartiers secrets que les touristes ne connaissent pas\r\n                    </h3>\r\n                    \r\n                    <p class=\"card-excerpt\" style=\"color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\r\n                        Découvrez le vrai visage de la Big Apple loin de Times Square. Des cafés hipsters de Bushwick aux jardins cachés de Harlem.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <div class=\"card-footer\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee;\">\r\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"read-link\" style=\"color: #ff5722; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\r\n                            Lire la suite\r\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i>\r\n                        </a>\r\n                        <div class=\"card-stats\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px;\">\r\n                            <div class=\"stat\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; color: #666; font-size: 0