.5rem; color: #1a365d; margin-left: 5px;\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"video-duration\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 15px; right: 15px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); color: white; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;\">\r\n                        8:24\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"video-content\" style=\"padding: 25px;\">\r\n                    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; color: white;\">\r\n                        Rencontre avec les éléphants en Thaïlande\r\n                    </h3>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                        Reportage exclusif dans un sanctuaire éthique pour éléphants\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <div class=\"video-meta\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"far fa-calendar\"></i> 1 semaine</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"far fa-eye\"></i> 12K vues</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Video 2 -->\r\n            <div class=\"video-card\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\r\n                <div class=\"video-thumbnail\" style=\"position: relative; height: 200px; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530521954074-e64f6810b32d\" alt=\"Roadtrip\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"play-btn\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 60px; height: 60px; background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.9); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-play\" style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; color: #1a365d; margin-left: 5px;\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"video-duration\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 15px; right: 15px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); color: white; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;\">\r\n                        15:42\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"video-content\" style=\"padding: 25px;\">\r\n                    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; color: white;\">\r\n                        Roadtrip sur la Route 66 : Le guide complet\r\n                    </h3>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                        Tous nos conseils pour traverser l\'Amérique en voiture\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <div class=\"video-meta\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"far fa-calendar\"></i> 2 semaines</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"far fa-eye\"></i> 24K vues</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            \r\n            <!-- Video 3 -->\r\n            <div class=\"video-card\" style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\r\n                <div class=\"video-thumbnail\" style=\"position: relative; height: 200px; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578662996442-48f60103fc96\" alt=\"Food\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"play-btn\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 60px; height: 60px; background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.9); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-play\" style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; color: #1a365d; margin-left: 5px;\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"video-duration\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 15px; right: 15px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); color: white; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;\">\r\n                        6:15\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"video-content\" style=\"padding: 25px;\">\r\n                    <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; color: white;\">\r\n                        Cours de cuisine à Naples avec un chef local\r\n                    </h3>\r\n                    <p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                        Apprenez les secrets de la vraie pizza napolitaine\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <div class=\"video-meta\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">\r\n                        <span><i class=\"far fa-calendar\"></i> 3 semaines</span>\r\n                        <span><i class=\"far fa-eye\"></i> 18K vues</span>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n$(document).ready(function() {\r\n    // Initialize Featured Swiper\r\n    const featuredSwiper = new Swiper(\'.featured-swiper\', {\r\n        direction: \'horizontal\',\r\n        loop: true,\r\n        speed: 800,\r\n        autoplay: {\r\n            delay: 8000,\r\n            disableOnInteraction: false,\r\n        },\r\n        navigation: {\r\n            nextEl: \'.swiper-button-next\',\r\n            prevEl: \'.swiper-button-prev\',\r\n        },\r\n        pagination: {\r\n            el: \'.swiper-pagination\',\r\n            clickable: true,\r\n            renderBullet: function (index, className) {\r\n                return \'<span class=\"\' + className + \'\">\' + (index + 1) + \'</span>\';\r\n            },\r\n        },\r\n        effect: \'fade\',\r\n        fadeEffect: {\r\n            crossFade: true\r\n        },\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // Filter functionality\r\n    $(\'.filter-btn\').click(function() {\r\n        // Update active button\r\n        $(\'.filter-btn\').removeClass(\'active\');\r\n        $(this).addClass(\'active\');\r\n        \r\n        // Get filter value\r\n        const filter = $(this).data(\'filter\');\r\n        \r\n        // Show all articles if \"all\" is selected\r\n        if (filter === \'all\') {\r\n            $(\'.news-card\').fadeIn(300);\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        // Filter articles\r\n        $(\'.news-card\').each(function() {\r\n            const category = $(this).data(\'category\');\r\n            \r\n            if (category === filter) {\r\n                $(this).fadeIn(300);\r\n            } else {\r\n                $(this).fadeOut(300);\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n        \r\n        // Animation for filter change\r\n        $(this).css(\'transform\', \'scale(0.95)\');\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            $(this).css(\'transform\', \'scale(1)\');\r\n        }, 200);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // Read more button hover effect\r\n    $(\'.read-more, .read-link\').hover(\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css(\'transform\', \'translateX(10px)\');\r\n        },\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css(\'transform\', \'translateX(0)\');\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    // News card hover effects\r\n    $(\'.news-card\').hover(\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(-15px)\',\r\n                \'box-shadow\': \'0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)\'\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            // Image zoom effect\r\n            $(this).find(\'.card-image img\').css(\'transform\', \'scale(1.1)\');\r\n            \r\n            // Title color change\r\n            $(this).find(\'.card-title\').css(\'color\', \'#004E92\');\r\n        },\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(0)\',\r\n                \'box-shadow\': \'0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)\'\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            // Reset image\r\n            $(this).find(\'.card-image img\').css(\'transform\', \'scale(1)\');\r\n            \r\n            // Reset title color\r\n            $(this).find(\'.card-title\').css(\'color\', \'#1a365d\');\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    // Video card hover effects\r\n    $(\'.video-card\').hover(\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(-10px)\',\r\n                \'background\': \'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)\'\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            $(this).find(\'.play-btn\').css({\r\n                \'transform\': \'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1)\',\r\n                \'background\': \'rgba(255, 215, 0, 1)\'\r\n            });\r\n        },\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(0)\',\r\n                \'background\': \'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)\'\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            $(this).find(\'.play-btn\').css({\r\n                \'transform\': \'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1)\',\r\n                \'background\': \'rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.9)\'\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    // Play button click\r\n    $(\'.play-btn\').click(function() {\r\n        const videoTitle = $(this).closest(\'.video-card\').find(\'h3\').text();\r\n        alert(\'Lecture de la vidéo : \"\' + videoTitle + \'\"\');\r\n        \r\n        // Animation\r\n        $(this).css(\'transform\', \'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.3)\');\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            $(this).css(\'transform\', \'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1)\');\r\n        }, 300);\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // Newsletter form submission\r\n    $(\'.subscribe-form\').submit(function(e) {\r\n        e.preventDefault();\r\n        const email = $(this).find(\'input[type=\"email\"]\').val();\r\n        \r\n        if (email) {\r\n            const submitBtn = $(this).find(\'button[type=\"submit\"]\');\r\n            const originalText = submitBtn.html();\r\n            \r\n            // Success animation\r\n            submitBtn.html(\'<i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i>\');\r\n            submitBtn.css({\r\n                \'background\': \'#4CAF50\',\r\n                \'color\': \'white\'\r\n            });\r\n            \r\n            // Reset form\r\n            $(this).find(\'input\').val(\'\');\r\n            \r\n            // Show success message\r\n            const successMsg = $(`<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #4CAF50; color: white;\">\r\n                <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> Merci pour votre inscription ! Vous recevrez notre prochaine newsletter.\r\n            </div>`);\r\n            \r\n            $(this).after(successMsg);\r\n            \r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                successMsg.fadeOut(300, function() {\r\n                    $(this).remove();\r\n                });\r\n                submitBtn.html(originalText);\r\n                submitBtn.css({\r\n                    \'background\': \'#FFD700\',\r\n                    \'color\': \'#004E92\'\r\n                });\r\n            }, 4000);\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // View all button hover\r\n    $(\'.view-all-btn\').hover(\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'background\': \'#004E92\',\r\n                \'color\': \'white\',\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(-5px)\',\r\n                \'box-shadow\': \'0 15px 30px rgba(0, 78, 146, 0.3)\'\r\n            });\r\n        },\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'background\': \'white\',\r\n                \'color\': \'#004E92\',\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(0)\',\r\n                \'box-shadow\': \'none\'\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    // Like button functionality\r\n    $(\'.stat .fa-heart\').click(function() {\r\n        const $this = $(this);\r\n        const $count = $this.next(\'span\');\r\n        let count = parseInt($count.text());\r\n        \r\n        if ($this.hasClass(\'far\')) {\r\n            $this.removeClass(\'far\').addClass(\'fas\');\r\n            $count.text(count + 1);\r\n            $this.css(\'color\', \'#dc2626\');\r\n            \r\n            // Animation\r\n            $this.css(\'transform\', \'scale(1.3)\');\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                $this.css(\'transform\', \'scale(1)\');\r\n            }, 300);\r\n        } else {\r\n            $this.removeClass(\'fas\').addClass(\'far\');\r\n            $count.text(count - 1);\r\n            $this.css(\'color\', \'\');\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // Share button functionality\r\n    $(\'.stat .fa-share-alt\').click(function() {\r\n        const $this = $(this);\r\n        const $count = $this.next(\'span\');\r\n        let count = parseInt($count.text());\r\n        \r\n        $count.text(count + 1);\r\n        \r\n        // Animation\r\n        $this.css(\'transform\', \'scale(1.3)\');\r\n        setTimeout(() => {\r\n            $this.css(\'transform\', \'scale(1)\');\r\n        }, 300);\r\n        \r\n        alert(\'Partagez cet article sur vos réseaux sociaux !\');\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n    // Featured article image hover\r\n    $(\'.featured-article\').hover(\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).find(\'.article-image img\').css(\'transform\', \'scale(1.05)\');\r\n        },\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).find(\'.article-image img\').css(\'transform\', \'scale(1)\');\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    // Tag hover effect\r\n    $(\'.tag\').hover(\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'background\': \'#004E92\',\r\n                \'color\': \'white\',\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(-3px)\'\r\n            });\r\n        },\r\n        function() {\r\n            $(this).css({\r\n                \'background\': \'#f1f8ff\',\r\n                \'color\': \'#004E92\',\r\n                \'transform\': \'translateY(0)\'\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    );\r\n    \r\n    // Input focus effects\r\n    $(\'input[type=\"email\"]\').focus(function() {\r\n        $(this).css(\'border-color\', \'#FFD700\');\r\n        $(this).next(\'i\').css(\'color\', \'#FFD700\');\r\n    }).blur(function() {\r\n        $(this).css(\'border-color\', \'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)\');\r\n        $(this).next(\'i\').css(\'color\', \'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7)\');\r\n    });\r\n});\r\n</script>', '/* News Section Animations et Styles */\r\n@keyframes slideInLeft {\r\n    from {\r\n        opacity: 0;\r\n        transform: translateX(-30px);\r\n    }\r\n    to {\r\n        opacity: 1;\r\n        transform: translateX(0);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes slideInRight {\r\n    from {\r\n        opacity: 0;\r\n        transform: translateX(30px);\r\n    }\r\n    to {\r\n        opacity: 1;\r\n        transform: translateX(0);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes fadeInUp {\r\n    from {\r\n        opacity: 0;\r\n        transform: translateY(30px);\r\n    }\r\n    to {\r\n        opacity: 1;\r\n        transform: translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes pulse {\r\n    0%, 100% {\r\n        transform: scale(1);\r\n    }\r\n    50% {\r\n        transform: scale(1.05);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes float {\r\n    0%, 100% {\r\n        transform: translateY(0);\r\n    }\r\n    50% {\r\n        transform: translateY(-10px);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes shimmer {\r\n    0% {\r\n        background-position: -200% center;\r\n    }\r\n    100% {\r\n        background-position: 200% center;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Section animations */\r\n.section-header {\r\n    animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.section-title {\r\n    animation: slideInLeft 0.8s ease-out 0.2s both;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.section-subtitle {\r\n    animation: slideInRight 0.8s ease-out 0.4s both;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Featured article animations */\r\n.featured-article {\r\n    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.article-badge {\r\n    animation: pulse 2s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.read-more {\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.read-more::after {\r\n    content: \"\";\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    left: -100%;\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    height: 100%;\r\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent);\r\n    transition: left 0.5s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.read-more:hover::after {\r\n    left: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Filter buttons animations */\r\n.filter-btn {\r\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.filter-btn.active {\r\n    animation: pulse 2s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.filter-btn:hover:not(.active) {\r\n    transform: translateY(-3px) !important;\r\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 78, 146, 0.15) !important;\r\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #004E92, #009999) !important;\r\n    color: white !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* News cards animations */\r\n.news-card {\r\n    animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.news-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }\r\n.news-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }\r\n.news-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }\r\n.news-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }\r\n.news-card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }\r\n.news-card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }\r\n\r\n.card-category {\r\n    transition: all 0.3s ease !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.news-card:hover .card-category {\r\n    transform: translateY(-5px) !important;\r\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Newsletter animations */\r\n.newsletter-icon {\r\n    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.subscribe-form button:hover {\r\n    transform: translateY(-3px) !important;\r\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4) !important;\r\n    animation: pulse 1s ease-in-out !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Video cards animations */\r\n.video-card {\r\n    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.video-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }\r\n.video-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }\r\n.video-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }\r\n\r\n.play-btn {\r\n    transition: all 0.3s ease !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.play-btn i {\r\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.play-btn:hover i {\r\n    transform: scale(1.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* View all button animation */\r\n.view-all-btn {\r\n    position: relative;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.view-all-btn::before {\r\n    content: \"\";\r\n    position: absolute;\r\n    top: 0;\r\n    left: -100%;\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    height: 100%;\r\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);\r\n    transition: left 0.5s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.view-all-btn:hover::before {\r\n    left: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Stats animations */\r\n.stat i {\r\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.stat i:hover {\r\n    transform: scale(1.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Featured swiper custom styles */\r\n.swiper-pagination-bullet {\r\n    width: 30px !important;\r\n    height: 30px !important;\r\n    background: white !important;\r\n    opacity: 0.5 !important;\r\n    color: #004E92 !important;\r\n    display: flex !important;\r\n    align-items: center !important;\r\n    justify-content: center !important;\r\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\r\n    font-size: 0.9rem !important;\r\n    border-radius: 50% !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.swiper-pagination-bullet-active {\r\n    opacity: 1 !important;\r\n    background: #FFD700 !important;\r\n    color: #004E92 !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.swiper-button-next, .swiper-button-prev {\r\n    transition: all 0.3s ease !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.swiper-button-next:hover, .swiper-button-prev:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\r\n    transform: scale(1.1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Meta items animations */\r\n.meta-item i {\r\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.meta-item:hover i {\r\n    transform: scale(1.2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Tag animations */\r\n.tag {\r\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) !important;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.tag i {\r\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.tag:hover i {\r\n    transform: rotate(15deg);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Input focus animation */\r\ninput[type=\"email\"]:focus {\r\n    animation: pulse 2s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Responsive Design */\r\n@media (max-width: 1200px) {\r\n    .featured-article {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\r\n        min-height: auto !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-image {\r\n        height: 400px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .news-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)) !important;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 992px) {\r\n    .section-title {\r\n        font-size: 2.5rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .featured-swiper {\r\n        margin: 0 -20px !important;\r\n        border-radius: 0 !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-content {\r\n        padding: 40px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-title {\r\n        font-size: 1.8rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .newsletter-subscribe {\r\n        padding: 40px 30px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .newsletter-subscribe h3 {\r\n        font-size: 2rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n    .voyage-news {\r\n        padding: 60px 20px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .section-title {\r\n        font-size: 2rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .section-subtitle {\r\n        font-size: 1.1rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .filters-container {\r\n        gap: 10px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .filter-btn {\r\n        padding: 10px 20px !important;\r\n        font-size: 0.9rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .news-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\r\n        gap: 30px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .newsletter-subscribe {\r\n        padding: 30px 20px !important;\r\n        border-radius: 20px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .newsletter-subscribe h3 {\r\n        font-size: 1.8rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .subscribe-form {\r\n        flex-direction: column !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .video-news h2 {\r\n        font-size: 2rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .video-grid {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 576px) {\r\n    .section-header {\r\n        margin-bottom: 40px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .section-title {\r\n        font-size: 1.8rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .featured-news {\r\n        margin-bottom: 40px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-image {\r\n        height: 300px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-content {\r\n        padding: 30px 20px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-title {\r\n        font-size: 1.5rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .article-meta {\r\n        flex-direction: column;\r\n        align-items: flex-start !important;\r\n        gap: 10px !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .view-all-btn {\r\n        padding: 15px 30px !important;\r\n        font-size: 1rem !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .swiper-button-next, .swiper-button-prev {\r\n        display: none !important;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Dark mode support */\r\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\r\n    .voyage-news {\r\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%) !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .section-title, .card-title {\r\n        color: #e2e8f0 !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .section-subtitle, .card-excerpt, .article-excerpt {\r\n        color: #94a3b8 !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .news-card, .featured-article .article-content {\r\n        background: #1e293b !important;\r\n        border: 1px solid #334155 !important;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .newsletter-subscribe {\r\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f3460 0%, #1a1a2e 100%) !important;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Loading animation for images */\r\n.article-image img, .card-image img, .video-thumbnail img {\r\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f0f0f0 25%, #e0e0e0 50%, #f0f0f0 75%);\r\n    background-size: 200% 100%;\r\n    animation: shimmer 1.5s infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes shimmer {\r\n    0% {\r\n        background-position: -200% 0;\r\n    }\r\n    100% {\r\n        background-position: 200% 0;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Accessibility focus styles */\r\na:focus, button:focus, input:focus {\r\n    outline: 2px solid #FFD700;\r\n    outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Smooth scrolling for anchor links */\r\nhtml {\r\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Print styles */\r\n@media print {\r\n    .voyage-news, .video-news {\r\n        break-inside: avoid;\r\n        page-break-inside: avoid;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .filter-btn, .read-more, .play-btn, .subscribe-form {\r\n        display: none !important;\r\n    }\r\n}', NULL, 9, '6', 'Travel & Tourism', '\"[\\\"actualités\\\",\\\"blog\\\",\\\"news\\\",\\\"articles\\\",\\\"voyage\\\",\\\"carrousel\\\",\\\"filtres\\\",\\\"vidéo\\\"]\"', 1, 1, 1200, NULL, 0, 1, 0, 4, 1, '2026-02-12 13:22:18', '2026-07-25 20:04:31');
INSERT INTO `blocks` (`id`, `categorie_id`, `name`, `slug`, `description`, `thumbnail`, `icon`, `html_content`, `css_content`, `js_content`, `section_id`, `category`, `website_type`, `tags`, `is_responsive`, `is_free`, `width`, `height`, `usage_count`, `views_count`, `rating`, `order`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(40, NULL, 'Avis Clients Voyage Premium', 'avis-clients-voyage-premium', 'Section témoignages clients élégante avec avis, notes, photos et carrousel pour agence de voyage', NULL, 'fa-comment-dots', '<!-- CDN pour GrapeJS -->\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.css\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/animate.css/4.1.1/animate.min.css\">\r\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n<!-- Section Avis Clients -->\r\n<section class=\"voyage-testimonials\" style=\"padding: 100px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #ffffff 100%); position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\r\n    <!-- Background Elements -->\r\n    <div class=\"bg-elements\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; pointer-events: none;\">\r\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 10%; right: 5%; width: 300px; height: 300px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 78, 146, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\r\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 20%; left: 5%; width: 200px; height: 200px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%;\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1;\">\r\n        <!-- Section Header -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-header\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 70px;\">\r\n            <div class=\"section-label\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FFD700, #FFA500); color: #004E92; padding: 8px 25px; border-radius: 25px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i> TÉMOIGNAGES\r\n            </div>\r\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"font-size: 3.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #1a365d;\">\r\n                Ils ont <span style=\"color: #004E92;\">voyagé</span> avec nous\r\n            </h2>\r\n            <p class=\"section-subtitle\" style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; color: #666; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\r\n                Découvrez les expériences authentiques de nos voyageurs à travers le monde\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Stats Overview -->\r\n        <div class=\"stats-overview\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px;\">\r\n            <div class=\"stat-card\" style=\"background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-icon\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #004E92, #009999); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px;\">\r\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-user-friends\" style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; color: white;\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-number\" style=\"font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #004E92; margin-bottom: 10px;\">5,842+</div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"color: #666; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Voyageurs Satisfaits</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"stat-card\" style=\"background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-icon\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #FFD700, #FFA500); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px;\">\r\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-globe-europe\" style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; color: #004E92;\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-number\" style=\"font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #004E92; margin-bottom: 10px;\">150+</div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"color: #666; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Destinations Couvertes</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"stat-card\" style=\"background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-icon\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #009999, #00CCCC); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px;\">\r\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-calendar-check\" style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; color: white;\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-number\" style=\"font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #004E92; margin-bottom: 10px;\">12,456+</div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"color: #666; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Voyages Organisés</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"stat-card\" style=\"background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease;\">\r\n                <div class=\"stat-icon\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #28a745, #20c997); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px;\">\r\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-award\" style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; color: white;\"></i>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-number\" style=\"font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #004E92; margin-bottom: 10px;\">4.9/5</div>\r\n                <div class=\"stat-label\" style=\"color: #666; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Note Moyenne</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n        <!-- Main Testimonials Carousel -->\r\n        <div class=\"testimonials-carousel\" style=\"margin-bottom: 80px;\">\r\n            <div class=\"swiper testimonials-swiper\" style=\"padding: 40px 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\r\n                    <!-- Testimonial 1 -->\r\n                    <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-card\" style=\"background: white; border-radius: 25px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); position: relative; height: 100%;\">\r\n                            <!-- Quote Icon -->\r\n                            <div class=\"quote-icon\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 30px; right: 30px; width: 60px; height: 60px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #004E92, #009999); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-size: 1.5rem;\">\r\n                                <i class=\"fas fa-quote-right\"></i>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Client Info -->\r\n                            <div class=\"client-info\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"client-avatar\" style=\"position: relative;\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"avatar-img\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; border: 4px solid #f1f8ff;\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108755-2616b612b786\" alt=\"Client\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"verified-badge\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #FFD700; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 3px solid white;\">\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-check\" style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; color: #004E92;\"></i>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"client-details\">\r\n                                    <h3 class=\"client-name\" style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #1a365d;\">Sophie Martin</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"client-trip\" style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\" style=\"color: #004E92; margin-right: 8px;\"></i>\r\n                                        Voyage en Japon - Mars 2024\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <!-- Star Rating -->\r\n                                    <div class=\"star-rating\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 5px;\">\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-star\" style=\"color: #FFD700;\"></i>\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-star\" style=\"color: #FFD700;\"></i>\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-star\" style=\"color: #FFD700;\"></i>\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-star\" style=\"color: #FFD700;\"></i>\r\n                                        <i class=\"fas fa-star\" style=\"color: #FFD700;\"></i>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Testimonial Content -->\r\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-content\" style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\">\r\n                                <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #555; font-style: italic;\">\r\n                                    \"Un voyage exceptionnel au Japon ! L\'équipe a su créer un itinéraire sur mesure qui combinait parfaitement culture traditionnelle et modernité. Les guides locaux étaient incroyablement connaisseurs et passionnants. Chaque détail était parfaitement organisé, des transports aux réservations des ryokans. Une expérience qui restera gravée dans nos mémoires.\"\r\n                                </p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Trip Highlights -->\r\n                            <div class=\"trip-highlights\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"highlight\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #f1f8ff; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #004E92;\">\r\n                                    <i class=\"fas fa-landmark\"></i>\r\n                                    <span>Tokyo & Kyoto</span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"highlight\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #f1f8ff; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #004E92;\">\r\n                                    <i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i>\r\n                                    <span>Dégustation culinaire</span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"highlight\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #f1f8ff; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #004E92;\">\r\n                                    <i class=\"fas fa-hotel\"></i>\r\n                                    <span>Ryokans traditionnels</span>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Photo Gallery -->\r\n                            <div class=\"trip-photos\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\r\n                                <div class=\"photo\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528164344705-47542687000d\" alt=\"Japon\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"photo\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542051841857-5f90071e7989\" alt=\"Temple\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"photo\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493976040374-85c8e12f0c0e\" alt=\"Mont Fuji\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div class=\"photo-more\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, #004E92, #009999); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                                    +5\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Verified Purchase -->\r\n                            <div class=\"ver