s=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i> Maroc</a></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <a href=\"#\" class=\"gxh__promo\">\n                <span class=\"gxh__promo-tag\">Nouveau</span>\n                <span class=\"gxh__promo-title\">Forfaits été 2026</span>\n                <span class=\"gxh__promo-text\">Jusqu\'à -30% sur une sélection de destinations.</span>\n                <span class=\"gxh__promo-link\">Découvrir <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\"></i></span>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n\n        <li class=\"gxh__item gxh__has-drop\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"gxhSubActivites\" class=\"gxh__subcheck\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n          <label for=\"gxhSubActivites\" class=\"gxh__sublabel\" role=\"button\">Activités <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down gxh__caret\"></i></label>\n          <ul class=\"gxh__drop\">\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-person-hiking\"></i> Randonnée</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-water\"></i> Sports nautiques</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-snowflake\"></i> Ski &amp; motoneige</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-utensils\"></i> Gastronomie</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n\n        <li class=\"gxh__item\"><a href=\"#\">Blog</a></li>\n        <li class=\"gxh__item\"><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"gxh__cta\">Réserver</a>\n    </nav>\n    <label for=\"gxhMegaMenu\" class=\"gxh__burger\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Ouvrir le menu\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></label>\n  </div>\n</header>', '', '', 2, 'Header', 'General', '[\"header\",\"fixed\",\"navbar\",\"responsive\",\"dark\"]', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 3, 0, 4, 1, '2026-07-19 14:45:26', '2026-07-25 19:39:43');
