rsor astro-bakowlib\"></span> </span> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <section x-data=\"sticky\" x-bind=\"eventHandlers\" class=\"sticky-story section wrapper sticky-story--align-left section--primary section--has-theme astro-3arsvgwz\" :class=\"{ \'sticky-story--has-scrolled-down\': hasScrolledDown }\"> <div class=\"sticky-story__text astro-3arsvgwz\"> <h2 class=\"sticky-story__text-heading type-giga astro-3arsvgwz\">Unrivalled Insight</h2> <p class=\"sticky-story__text-copy astro-3arsvgwz\">We\'ve lived, worked and raced on the water, so we know yachts inside out. We’ll make your yachting experience as seamless as it is sensational.</p> </div> <div class=\"sticky-story__gallery-item aspect-16/9 astro-3arsvgwz\"> <video class=\"js-video-lazy card__media astro-3arsvgwz\" preload=\"none\" autoplay loop muted playsinline width=\"1280\" poster=\"https://cdn-video.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,so_auto,w_2560/v1706170813/Services/Y_CO_-_Yacht_Management_vsi8wy.jpg\"> <source data-src=\"https://cdn-video.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_1280/v1706170813/Services/Y_CO_-_Yacht_Management_vsi8wy.webm\" type=\"video/webm\"> <source data-src=\"https://cdn-video.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_1280/v1706170813/Services/Y_CO_-_Yacht_Management_vsi8wy.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"> </source></source></video> </div> </section> <div class=\"section-grid section wrapper astro-iaa4srpt\"> <div class=\"grid-row items-center grid-row--1-col astro-46u27ry3\"> <div class=\"grid-row__item astro-46u27ry3\"> <div class=\"stack-column stack-column--has-copy stack-column--align-x-center\"> <div class=\"stack-column__media\"> </div> <div class=\"stack-column__content\"> <div class=\"rich-text\" style=\"align-items:center\"> <h1 class=\"type-h1\">Amazing...</h1> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"grid-row items-center grid-row--1-col astro-46u27ry3\"> <div class=\"grid-row__item astro-46u27ry3\"> <div class=\"stack-column\"> <div class=\"stack-column__media\"> <div cl