erméables + Gants cuir</p><div class=\"showcase-price\">449€<span>/pack</span></div></div></div></section><!-- Footer --></div><!-- Script minimal pour les interactions - PAS DE FILTRES, PAS DE JS COMPLEXE --></body>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}body{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font-family:Raleway, sans-serif;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(248, 249, 250) 0%, rgb(232, 244, 248) 100%);background-position-x:initial;background-position-y:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:initial;color:rgb(44, 62, 80);line-height:1.6;min-height:100vh;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;overflow-x:hidden;}:root{--winter-blue:#2C3E50;--ice-blue:#ECF0F1;--frost-white:#F8F9FA;--silver:#BDC3C7;--icy-teal:#1ABC9C;--cold-purple:#9B59B6;--warm-gray:#7F8C8D;--burgundy:#8B0000;--navy:#000080;--snow-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1);--frost-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(189, 195, 199, 0.2);--glow-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(26, 188, 156, 0.15);--radius-lg:20px;--radius-md:12px;--radius-sm:8px;--transition-smooth:0.5s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);--transition-bounce:0.6s cubic-bezier(0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55);}*{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;box-sizing:border-box;}body{font-family:Raleway, sans-serif;color:var(--winter-blue);line-height:1.6;min-height:100vh;padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;overflow-x:hidden;}.container{max-width:1400px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;padding-top:0px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:20px;}