lture</span><span>Festival International</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Culture 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZMx6Rqy6h2Y?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">6:15</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Musée des Beaux-Arts de Montréal</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Visite des collections d\'art québécois et international.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Culture</span><span>Art et histoire</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Bloc 4: Vidéos Gastronomie --><div id=\"gastronomie-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container\"><div class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Vidéo Gastronomie 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Dwvd2FhUwIE?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">15:30</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Saveurs du Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Tour d\'horizon des plats traditionnels québécois.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Gastronomie</span><span>Recettes du terroir</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Gastronomie 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MlzGGMH3kys?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">12:10</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Cabanes à sucre du Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Découverte des traditions du sirop d\'érable.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Gastronomie</span><span>Traditions culinaires</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Bloc 5: Vidéos Aventures --><div id=\"aventures-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container\"><div class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Vidéo Aventures 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ay6DnI7fR_c?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">10:15</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Ski dans les Laurentides</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Les meilleures stations de ski de l\'est du Canada.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Aventures</span><span>Sports d\'hiver</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Aventures 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tmn9inxTvPo?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">8:40</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Kayak de mer en Gaspésie</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Exploration des côtes gaspésiennes en kayak.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Aventures</span><span>Sports nautiques</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Carrousel 4: Événements vedettes --></div></body>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;}:root{--primary:#e30613;--primary-dark:#b3050f;--secondary:#0b6e4f;--light:#f8f9fa;--dark:#212529;--gray:#6c757d;--gray-light:#e9ecef;--accent:#ffd166;--success:#4cc9f0;--danger:#f72585;--warning:#ff9e00;--border-radius:12px;--shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);--shadow-hover:0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);--transition:all 0.3s ease;}*{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;box-sizing:border-box;}body{font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);background-color:rgb(245, 247, 255);padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;max-width:1400px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;}.container{width:100%;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;padding-top:0px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:15px;}.carousel-container{margin-bottom:80px;}.carousel-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:25px;}.carousel-title{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;}.carousel-items{display:flex;row-gap:25px;column-gap:25px;overflow-x:auto;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:5px;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;}.carousel-items::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}.carousel-item{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:0;flex-basis:auto;width:320px;background-color:white;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}.carousel-item:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);}.video-container{position:relative;width:100%;height:180px;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;}.video-iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border-top-width:initial;border-right-width:initial;border-bottom-width:initial;border-left-width:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-top-color:initial;border-right-color:initial;border-bottom-color:initial;border-left-color:initial;border-image-source:initial;border-image-slice:initial;border-image-width:initial;border-image-outset:initial;border-image-repeat:initial;}.video-overlay{position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;background-image:linear-gradient(transparent 60%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 100%);background-position-x:initial;background-position-y:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:initial;pointer-events:none;}.video-duration{position:absolute;bottom:10px;right:10px;background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);color:white;padding-top:3px;padding-right:8px;padding-bottom:3px;padding-left:8px;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;font-size:0.8rem;}.carousel-item-content{padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;}.carousel-item-title{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--dark);}.carousel-item-description{font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.5;}.carousel-item-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--gray);}.filter-btn.active{background-color:var(--primary);color:white;}.video-blocks-container{display:none;}.video-blocks-container.active{display:block;}.grapejs-editable{outline-color:rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.2);outline-style:dashed;outline-width:2px;outline-offset:2px;transition-behavior:normal;transition-duration:0.2s;transition-timing-function:ease;transition-delay:0s;transition-property:outline;min-height:1.5em;min-width:20px;}.grapejs-editable:hover{outline-color:rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.5);outline-style:dashed;outline-width:2px;}@media (max-width: 992px){.carousel-item{width:280px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.carousel-header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;row-gap:15px;column-gap:15px;}.carousel-title{font-size:1.6rem;}}@media (max-width: 576px){.carousel-item{width:250px;}}', NULL, 'draft', NULL, '2026-02-06 17:45:02', '2026-02-12 15:22:18');
INSERT INTO `menus` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `type`, `parent_id`, `reference_id`, `menu_type`, `order`, `route`, `url`, `icon`, `is_active`, `has_page`, `page_id`, `page_content`, `page_styles`, `page_meta`, `page_status`, `page_slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(26, 'ÉVÉNEMENTS VEDETTES', 'evenements-vedettes-go-exploria', 'custom', 3, NULL, 'Accueil', 0, NULL, '#mosts-au-quebec', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '<body><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><div class=\"container\"><!-- En-tête de la page --><header class=\"section-header\"><h2 class=\"section-subtitle\">Découvrez les meilleurs du Québec</h2><h1 class=\"section-title\">LES MOSTS AU QUÉBEC</h1><p class=\"section-description\">\n                Explorez les entreprises, régions, activités, vidéos et événements les plus remarquables du Québec. Notre sélection exclusive vous guide vers les meilleures expériences.\n            </p></header><!-- Carrousel 1: Entreprises --><section class=\"carousel-container\"></section><!-- Carrousel 2: Régions --><!-- Section Liens rapides --><!-- Section 3: Vidéos vedettes avec filtres --><section class=\"carousel-container\"><!-- Bloc 1: Toutes les vidéos --><div id=\"all-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container active\"></div><!-- Bloc 2: Vidéos Nature --><div id=\"nature-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container\"><div class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Vidéo Nature 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqpsO4l_qYQ?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">5:42</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Aurores boréales au Nunavik</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Spectacle naturel époustouflant dans le Grand Nord québécois.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Nature</span><span>Tourisme Québec</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Nature 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZdHjKTv8bIE?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">7:45</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Parc national de la Gaspésie</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Randonnée au cœur des montagnes gaspésiennes.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Nature</span><span>Parcs Canada</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Nature 3 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RpZ7NiZ00jk?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">9:20</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Fjord du Saguenay</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Navigation spectaculaire dans l\'un des plus beaux fjords du monde.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Nature</span><span>Aventures maritimes</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Bloc 3: Vidéos Culture --><div id=\"culture-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container\"><div class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Vidéo Culture 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z7T0OnbBkG4?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">8:22</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Festival de jazz de Montréal</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">L\'un des plus grands festivals de jazz au monde.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Culture</span><span>Festival International</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Culture 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZMx6Rqy6h2Y?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">6:15</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Musée des Beaux-Arts de Montréal</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Visite des collections d\'art québécois et international.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Culture</span><span>Art et histoire</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Bloc 4: Vidéos Gastronomie --><div id=\"gastronomie-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container\"><div class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Vidéo Gastronomie 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Dwvd2FhUwIE?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">15:30</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Saveurs du Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Tour d\'horizon des plats traditionnels québécois.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Gastronomie</span><span>Recettes du terroir</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Gastronomie 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MlzGGMH3kys?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">12:10</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Cabanes à sucre du Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Découverte des traditions du sirop d\'érable.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Gastronomie</span><span>Traditions culinaires</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Bloc 5: Vidéos Aventures --><div id=\"aventures-videos\" class=\"video-blocks-container\"><div class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Vidéo Aventures 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ay6DnI7fR_c?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">10:15</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Ski dans les Laurentides</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Les meilleures stations de ski de l\'est du Canada.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Aventures</span><span>Sports d\'hiver</span></div></div></div><!-- Vidéo Aventures 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tmn9inxTvPo?\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" class=\"video-iframe\"></iframe><div class=\"video-overlay\"></div><div class=\"video-duration\">8:40</div></div><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Kayak de mer en Gaspésie</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Exploration des côtes gaspésiennes en kayak.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Aventures</span><span>Sports nautiques</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Carrousel 4: Événements vedettes --><section class=\"carousel-container\"><div class=\"carousel-header\"><h3 class=\"carousel-title\">Événements vedettes au Québec</h3><div class=\"carousel-controls\"><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Précédent\" class=\"carousel-btn prev-btn\" id=\"i03zf2\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Suivant\" class=\"carousel-btn next-btn\" id=\"iiilfr\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div></div><div id=\"evenements-carousel\" class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Événement 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"event-date\">15-24 JUIN</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533174072545-7a4b6ad7a6c3?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Festival d\'été\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Festival d\'été de Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Le plus grand festival extérieur en Amérique du Nord avec des artistes internationaux.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"itckg7\">Québec</span><span>Scènes extérieures</span></div></div></div><!-- Événement 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"event-date\">28 FÉV - 10 MAR</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511795409834-ef04bbd61622?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Carnaval de Québec\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Carnaval de Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Le plus grand carnaval d\'hiver au monde avec Bonhomme Carnaval comme ambassadeur.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"iu4t3u\">Québec</span><span id=\"ixsuwg\">Activités hivernales</span></div></div></div><!-- Événement 3 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"event-date\">AOÛT 2024</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470225620780-dba8ba36b745?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Festival de musique\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Osheaga</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Festival de musique et arts contemporains sur l\'île Sainte-Hélène à Montréal.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"i7hsgk\">Montréal</span><span>Musique &amp; Arts</span></div></div></div><!-- Événement 4 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><div class=\"event-date grapejs-editable\">OCT 2024</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533174072545-7a4b6ad7a6c3?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Festival des couleurs\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title grapejs-editable\">Festival des couleurs</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description grapejs-editable\">Célébration de l\'automne et des magnifiques paysages colorés des Cantons-de-l\'Est.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span class=\"grapejs-editable\">Cantons-de-l\'Est</span><span>Nature &amp; Culture</span></div></div></div></div></section></div></body>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}:root{--primary:#e30613;--primary-dark:#b3050f;--secondary:#0b6e4f;--light:#f8f9fa;--dark:#212529;--gray:#6c757d;--gray-light:#e9ecef;--accent:#ffd166;--success:#4cc9f0;--danger:#f72585;--warning:#ff9e00;--border-radius:12px;--shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);--shadow-hover:0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);--transition:all 0.3s ease;}*{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;box-sizing:border-box;}body{font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);background-color:rgb(245, 247, 255);padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;max-width:1400px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;}.container{width:100%;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;padding-top:0px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:15px;}.section-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;max-width:800px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}.section-subtitle{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--secondary);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:10px;display:inline-block;position:relative;}.section-subtitle::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:40px;height:3px;bottom:-5px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}.section-title{font-size:2.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--dark);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;}.section-description{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--gray);max-width:600px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;}.carousel-container{margin-bottom:80px;}.carousel-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:25px;}.carousel-title{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;}.carousel-controls{display:flex;row-gap:10px;column-gap:10px;}.carousel-btn{background-color:var(--primary);color:white;border-top-width:initial;border-right-width:initial;border-bottom-width:initial;border-left-width:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-top-color:initial;border-right-color:initial;border-bottom-color:initial;border-left-color:initial;border-image-source:initial;border-image-slice:initial;border-image-width:initial;border-image-outset:initial;border-image-repeat:initial;width:40px;height:40px;border-top-left-radius:50%;border-top-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-left-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.carousel-btn:hover{background-color:var(--primary-dark);transform:scale(1.05);}.carousel-items{display:flex;row-gap:25px;column-gap:25px;overflow-x:auto;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:5px;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;}.carousel-items::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}.carousel-item{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:0;flex-basis:auto;width:320px;background-color:white;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}.carousel-item:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);}.carousel-item-img{width:100%;height:180px;object-fit:cover;}.video-container{position:relative;width:100%;height:180px;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;}.video-iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border-top-width:initial;border-right-width:initial;border-bottom-width:initial;border-left-width:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-top-color:initial;border-right-color:initial;border-bottom-color:initial;border-left-color:initial;border-image-source:initial;border-image-slice:initial;border-image-width:initial;border-image-outset:initial;border-image-repeat:initial;}.video-overlay{position:absolute;top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;background-image:linear-gradient(transparent 60%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 100%);background-position-x:initial;background-position-y:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:initial;pointer-events:none;}.video-duration{position:absolute;bottom:10px;right:10px;background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);color:white;padding-top:3px;padding-right:8px;padding-bottom:3px;padding-left:8px;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;font-size:0.8rem;}.carousel-item-content{padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;}.carousel-item-title{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--dark);}.carousel-item-description{font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.5;}.carousel-item-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--gray);}.event-date{background-color:var(--secondary);color:white;padding-top:8px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin-bottom:15px;display:inline-block;}.filter-btn.active{background-color:var(--primary);color:white;}.video-blocks-container{display:none;}.video-blocks-container.active{display:block;}.grapejs-editable{outline-color:rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.2);outline-style:dashed;outline-width:2px;outline-offset:2px;transition-behavior:normal;transition-duration:0.2s;transition-timing-function:ease;transition-delay:0s;transition-property:outline;min-height:1.5em;min-width:20px;}.grapejs-editable:hover{outline-color:rgba(227, 6, 19, 0.5);outline-style:dashed;outline-width:2px;}@media (max-width: 992px){.carousel-item{width:280px;}.section-title{font-size:2.4rem;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.section-title{font-size:2.2rem;}.carousel-header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;row-gap:15px;column-gap:15px;}.carousel-title{font-size:1.6rem;}}@media (max-width: 576px){.section-header{margin-bottom:40px;}.section-title{font-size:1.9rem;}.carousel-item{width:250px;}}', NULL, 'draft', NULL, '2026-02-06 17:49:18', '2026-02-12 15:22:06');
INSERT INTO `menus` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `type`, `parent_id`, `reference_id`, `menu_type`, `order`, `route`, `url`, `icon`, `is_active`, `has_page`, `page_id`, `page_content`, `page_styles`, `page_meta`, `page_status`, `page_slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(27, 'DESTINATIONS VEDETTES', 'destinations-vedettes', 'custom', 3, NULL, 'Accueil', 4, NULL, '#mosts-au-quebec', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '<body><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><div class=\"container\"><!-- En-tête de la page --><header class=\"section-header\"></header><!-- Carrousel 1: Entreprises --><!-- Carrousel 2: Régions --><section class=\"carousel-container\"><div class=\"carousel-header\"><h3 class=\"carousel-title\">Régions à découvrir</h3><div class=\"carousel-controls\"><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Précédent\" class=\"carousel-btn prev-btn\" id=\"iw4vl\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Suivant\" class=\"carousel-btn next-btn\" id=\"irpyc\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div></div><div id=\"regions-carousel\" class=\"carousel-items\"><!-- Région 1 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Vieux-Québec\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Vieux-Québec</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Seule ville fortifiée en Amérique du Nord, patrimoine mondial de l\'UNESCO.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"im7dbx\">Québec</span><span class=\"carousel-item-rating\">★★★★★</span></div></div></div><!-- Région 2 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Montréal\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Montréal métropolitain</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Ville vibrante alliant histoire, culture, gastronomie et vie nocturne animée.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"ict6rh\">Montréal</span><span class=\"carousel-item-rating\">★★★★★</span></div></div></div><!-- Région 3 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Charlevoix\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Charlevoix</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Région reconnue pour ses paysages magnifiques, sa gastronomie et ses artistes.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"isg7sg\">Charlevoix</span><span class=\"carousel-item-rating\">★★★★★</span></div></div></div><!-- Région 4 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Gaspésie\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Gaspésie</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Péninsule sauvage offrant des paysages côtiers spectaculaires et une faune riche.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"iuchc7\">Gaspésie</span><span class=\"carousel-item-rating\">★★★★☆</span></div></div></div><!-- Région 5 --><div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544551763-46a013bb70d5?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Cantons-de-l\'Est\" class=\"carousel-item-img\"/><div class=\"carousel-item-content\"><h4 class=\"carousel-item-title\">Cantons-de-l\'Est</h4><p class=\"carousel-item-description\">Région de collines verdoyantes, vignobles, érablières et villages pittoresques.</p><div class=\"carousel-item-meta\"><span id=\"iyv9l8\">Cantons-de-l\'Est</span><span class=\"carousel-item-rating\">★★★★☆</span></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section Liens rapides --><!-- Section 3: Vidéos vedettes avec filtres --><!-- Carrousel 4: Événements vedettes --></div></body>', '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}:root{--primary:#e30613;--primary-dark:#b3050f;--secondary:#0b6e4f;--light:#f8f9fa;--dark:#212529;--gray:#6c757d;--gray-light:#e9ecef;--accent:#ffd166;--success:#4cc9f0;--danger:#f72585;--warning:#ff9e00;--border-radius:12px;--shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);--shadow-hover:0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);--transition:all 0.3s ease;}*{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;box-sizing:border-box;}body{font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);background-color:rgb(245, 247, 255);padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;max-width:1400px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;}.container{width:100%;margin-top:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:auto;padding-top:0px;padding-right:15px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:15px;}.section-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;max-width:800px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}.carousel-container{margin-bottom:80px;}.carousel-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:25px;}.carousel-title{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;}.carousel-controls{display:flex;row-gap:10px;column-gap:10px;}.carousel-btn{background-color:var(--primary);color:white;border-top-width:initial;border-right-width:initial;border-bottom-width:initial;border-left-width:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-top-color:initial;border-right-color:initial;border-bottom-color:initial;border-left-color:initial;border-image-source:initial;border-image-slice:initial;border-image-width:initial;border-image-outset:initial;border-image-repeat:initial;width:40px;height:40px;border-top-left-radius:50%;border-top-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-left-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.carousel-btn:hover{background-color:var(--primary-dark);transform:scale(1.05);}.carousel-items{display:flex;row-gap:25px;column-gap:25px;overflow-x:auto;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:5px;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;}.carousel-items::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}.carousel-item{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:0;flex-basis:auto;width:320px;background-color:white;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}.carousel-item:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);}.carousel-item-img{width:100%;height:180px;object-fit:cover;}.carousel-item-content{padding-top:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:20px;}.carousel-item-title{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--dark);}.carousel-item-description{font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:15px;line-height:1.5;}.carousel-item-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--gray);}.carousel-item-rating{color:var(--accent);}@media (max-width: 992px){.carousel-item{width:280px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.carousel-header{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;row-gap:15px;column-gap:15px;}.carousel-title{font-size:1.6rem;}}@media (max-width: 576px){.section-header{margin-bottom:40px;}.carousel-item{width:250px;}}', NULL, 'draft', NULL, '2026-02-06 17:51:14', '2026-02-12 15:22:34');
INSERT INTO `menus` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `type`, `parent_id`, `reference_id`, `menu_type`, `order`, `route`, `url`, `icon`, `is_active`, `has_page`, `page_id`, `page_content`, `page_styles`, `page_meta`, `page_status`, `page_slug`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(28, 'PRODUITS VEDETTES', 'produits-vedettes', 'custom', 3, NULL, 'Accueil', 5, NULL, '#produits-vedettes', NULL, 1, 0, NULL, '\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Raleway:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.4.min.js\"></script>\n    \n<body data-gjs-type=\"body\">\n    <div class=\"container\" data-gjs-type=\"container\" data-gjs-draggable=\"false\">\n        <!-- En-tête avec effet de neige -->\n        <header class=\"fashion-header\" data-gjs-type=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"snow-effect\" id=\"snow-container\" data-gjs-type=\"snow-effect\"></div>\n            <div class=\"header-content\" data-gjs-type=\"header-content\">\n                <div class=\"season-badge\" data-gjs-type=\"badge\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Collection Hiver 2023</div>\n                <h1 class=\"main-title\" data-gjs-type=\"title\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Élégance Hivernale</h1>\n                <p class=\"header-subtitle\" data-gjs-type=\"subtitle\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Découvrez notre collection exclusive de vêtements et accessoires d&#39;hiver, alliant confort, style et chaleur pour affronter la saison froide avec élégance.</p>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Navigation des catégories -->\n        <nav class=\"category-nav\" data-gjs-type=\"category-nav\">\n            <button class=\"category-btn active\" data-category=\"all\" data-gjs-type=\"category-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-snowflake\"></i> Tous\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"category-btn\" data-category=\"outerwear\" data-gjs-type=\"category-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-vest\"></i> Vêtements chauds\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"category-btn\" data-category=\"knitwear\" data-gjs-type=\"category-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-tshirt\"></i> Pulls & Gilets\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"category-btn\" data-category=\"accessories\" data-gjs-type=\"category-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-mitten\"></i> Accessoires\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"category-btn\" data-category=\"footwear\" data-gjs-type=\"category-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-boot\"></i> Chaussures\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"category-btn\" data-category=\"baselayers\" data-gjs-type=\"category-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-thermometer\"></i> Sous-vêtements\n            </button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Section Tous les produits -->\n        <section class=\"products-section\" id=\"all-products\" data-gjs-type=\"products-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-gjs-type=\"section-title\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Tous nos produits d&#39;hiver</h2>\n            <div class=\"products-grid\" id=\"products-container\" data-gjs-type=\"products-grid\">\n                <!-- Les produits seront générés par JavaScript -->\n                <!-- Exemple de carte produit pour l\'éditeur -->\n                <div class=\"product-card\" data-gjs-type=\"product-card\">\n                    <div class=\"product-card-badge new\" data-gjs-type=\"product-badge\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Nouveau</div>\n                    <div class=\"product-card-image\" data-gjs-type=\"product-image\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552374196-1ab2a1c593e8?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Produit d\'hiver\" data-gjs-type=\"image\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                        <button class=\"quick-view-btn\" data-id=\"1\" data-gjs-type=\"quick-view-button\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i> Voir le produit\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"product-card-content\" data-gjs-type=\"product-content\">\n                        <h3 class=\"product-card-title\" data-gjs-type=\"product-title\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Manteau Long Himalaya</h3>\n                        <div class=\"product-card-price\" data-gjs-type=\"product-price\">\n                            <span class=\"current-price\" data-gjs-type=\"current-price\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">189,99 €</span>\n                            <span class=\"original-price\" data-gjs-type=\"original-price\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">249,99 €</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"product-card-colors\" data-gjs-type=\"product-colors\">\n                            <div class=\"color-dot\" style=\"background-color: #2C3E50;\" data-gjs-type=\"color-dot\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"color-dot\" style=\"background-color: #ECF0F1;\" data-gjs-type=\"color-dot\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"color-dot\" style=\"background-color: #7F8C8D;\" data-gjs-type=\"color-dot\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"product-card-sizes\" data-gjs-type=\"product-sizes\">\n                            <span class=\"size-chip\" data-gjs-type=\"size-chip\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">XS</span>\n                            <span class=\"size-chip\" data-gjs-type=\"size-chip\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">S</span>\n                            <span class=\"size-chip\" data-gjs-type=\"size-chip\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">M</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"fashion-footer\" data-gjs-type=\"footer\">\n            <div class=\"footer-links\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-links\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Nouveautés</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Homme</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Femme</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Enfant</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Guide des tailles</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-link\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Livraison & Retours</a>\n            </div>\n            <p data-gjs-type=\"footer-text\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">© 2023 Winter Collection. Tous droits réservés.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 10px; color: #95A5A6;\" data-gjs-type=\"footer-note\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Images réelles de notre collection hiver</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Modal de produit -->\n    <div class=\"product-modal-overlay\" id=\"product-modal-overlay\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-overlay\">\n        <div class=\"product-modal\" id=\"product-modal\" data-gjs-type=\"modal\">\n            <button class=\"modal-close\" id=\"modal-close\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-close\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"modal-content\" id=\"modal-content\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-content\">\n                <!-- Le contenu sera rempli par JavaScript -->\n                <!-- Exemple pour l\'éditeur -->\n                <div class=\"modal-gallery\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-gallery\">\n                    <div class=\"modal-main-image\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-main-image\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552374196-1ab2a1c593e8?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\" alt=\"Produit\" data-gjs-type=\"image\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"modal-thumbnails\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-thumbnails\">\n                        <div class=\"modal-thumbnail active\" data-index=\"0\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-thumbnail\">\n                            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552374196-1ab2a1c593e8?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80\" alt=\"Miniature\" data-gjs-type=\"image\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"modal-details\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-details\">\n                    <span class=\"modal-category\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-category\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Vêtements chauds</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"modal-title\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-title\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Manteau Long Himalaya</h2>\n                    <div class=\"modal-price\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-price\">\n                        <span class=\"modal-current-price\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-current-price\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">189,99 €</span>\n                        <span class=\"modal-original-price\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-original-price\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">249,99 €</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"modal-description\" data-gjs-type=\"modal-description\" data-gjs-editable=\"true\">Manteau d&#39;hiver long en laine mérinos premium avec isolation thermique avancée.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Données complètes des produits par catégorie\n        const winterProducts = {\n            outerwear: [\n                {\n                    id: 1,\n                    name: \"Manteau Long Himalaya\",\n                    category: \"outerwear\",\n             