</span>\n                </a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"#avis-clients\" class=\"snb-link\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\n                    <span>CUSTOMER REVIEW AREAS</span>\n                </a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"#espace-templates\" class=\"snb-link\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-layer-group\"></i>\n                    <span>ESPACES TEMPLATES</span>\n                </a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"#espace-mail-marketing\" class=\"snb-link\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i>\n                    <span>ESPACES MAIL MARKETING</span>\n                </a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"#espace-chat\" class=\"snb-link\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-comments\"></i>\n                    <span>CAT MODULE SPACES</span>\n                </a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"#espace-blog\" class=\"snb-link\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-rss\"></i>\n                    <span>BLOG AREAS</span>\n                </a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"snb-scroll-controls\" aria-label=\"Navigation horizontale\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"snb-scroll-btn snb-scroll-left\" aria-label=\"Defiler vers la gauche\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i>\n            </button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"snb-scroll-btn snb-scroll-right\" aria-label=\"Defiler vers la droite\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</nav>\n\n            <div class=\"resto-header-destinations-bar\">\n                <div class=\"resto-dest-row\">\n    <div class=\"resto-dest-icon-box\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://goexploriabusiness.com/REDI.png\" alt=\"Destinations\">\n        <span>Destinations</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"resto-dest-breadcrumb vp-dest-breadcrumb\">\n        <select id=\"vp-continent-select\" class=\"vp-dest-select\" aria-label=\"Continent\">\n            <option value=\"amerique-nord\">North America</option>\n            <option value=\"europe\">Europe</option>\n            <option value=\"afrique\">Africa</option>\n            <option value=\"asie\">Asia</option>\n            <option value=\"amerique-sud\">Amérique du Sud</option>\n            <option value=\"oceanie\">Océanie</option>\n        </select>\n        <span class=\"resto-dest-sep\">/</span>\n        <select id=\"vp-country-select\" class=\"vp-dest-select\" aria-label=\"Pays\">\n            <option value=\"canada\">Canada</option>\n        </select>\n        <span class=\"resto-dest-sep\">/</span>\n        <select id=\"vp-province-select\" class=\"vp-dest-select\" aria-label=\"Province\">\n            <option value=\"quebec\">Quebec</option>\n            <option value=\"ontario\">Ontario</option>\n            <option value=\"alberta\">Alberta</option>\n            <option value=\"colombie-britannique\">Colombie-Britannique</option>\n            <option value=\"nouvelle-ecosse\">Nouvelle-Écosse</option>\n        </select>\n        <span class=\"resto-dest-sep\">/</span>\n        <select id=\"vp-region-select\" class=\"vp-dest-select\" aria-label=\"Region\">\n            <option value=\"region-de-quebec\">Quebec region</option>\n            <option value=\"montreal-metro\">Montréal Métro</option>\n            <option value=\"mauricie\">Mauricie</option>\n            <option value=\"gaspesie\">Gaspésie</option>\n            <option value=\"saguenay\">Saguenay</option>\n        </select>\n    </div>\n</div>\n                <div class=\"resto-actions-row\">\n                    <div class=\"resto-header-ctas\">\n                        <div class=\"gic-categories\">\n                            <button class=\"gic-filter-btn gic-filter-btn--wide active\" type=\"button\" data-cat=\"all\"><i class=\"fas fa-th-large\"></i> All categories</button>\n                            <button class=\"gic-filter-btn gic-filter-btn--chip\" type=\"button\" data-cat=\"nature\"><i class=\"fas fa-leaf\"></i> Nature</button>\n                            <button class=\"gic-filter-btn gic-filter-btn--tall\" type=\"button\" data-cat=\"culture\"><i class=\"fas fa-landmark\"></i> Culture</button>\n                            <button class=\"gic-filter-btn gic-filter-btn--pill\" type=\"button\" data-cat=\"gastronomie\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i> Gastronomy</button>\n                            <button class=\"gic-filter-btn gic-filter-btn--soft\" type=\"button\" data-cat=\"aventure\"><i class=\"fas fa-mountain\"></i> Adventure</button>\n                            <button class=\"gic-filter-btn gic-filter-btn--chip\" type=\"button\" data-cat=\"urbain\"><i class=\"fas fa-city\"></i> Urbain</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"resto-header-shimmer\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gic-layout\" id=\"gicMasonry\">\n                            <div class=\"gic-row\">\n                                            <article class=\"gic-card gic-card--h\" style=\"--gic-ratio: 16 / 10;\" data-dest=\"amerique-nord\" data-cat=\"nature\" data-tags=\"#international #canada #winter #nordic\">\n                            <div class=\"gic-media-wrap\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?w=900&amp;h=1200&amp;fit=crop\" alt=\"Aurores Nordiques\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"gic-save-btn\"><i class=\"fas fa-thumbtack\"></i> Enregistrer</button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"gic-more-btn\" aria-label=\"More\"><i class=\"fas fa-ellipsis-h\"></i></button>\n                    