g class=\"card__media\" src=\"https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_460/v1705630543/cruiseArea/Greece-Cruising-Area/z56kpl19gmsanjqta7v7.jpg\" alt=\"Greece Gone Wild\" width=\"460\"> </source></source></picture> </div> <div class=\"card__cover card-info__cover aspect-4/5 md:aspect-3/2\" lang=\"de\"> <p class=\"card-info__subheading type-subtitle\">8 Days</p> <h3 class=\"card-info__heading type-h3\">Greece Gone Wild</h3> <p class=\"card-info__copy\">Skopolos to Koupanaries Beach. Cruise through Greece’s wildest archipelago. Private island picnics, seabob safaris and hundreds of deserted beaches.</p> <span class=\"card-info__linkText ui-link type-subtitle ui-link--size-large ui-link--type-white astro-7qpaljxn\"> <span class=\"ui-link__box astro-7qpaljxn\"> <span class=\"ui-link__text astro-7qpaljxn\" data-replace=\"Explore\"> Explore </span> </span> </span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </a> </div><div class=\"carousel-card__slide astro-4dlp7wvt\"> <a class=\"card-wrapper\" href=\"/yacht-charter/itinerary/svalbard-cruising-guide\" target=\"_self\" aria-label=\"Read More\"> <div class=\"card card-info\" data-test-id=\"card-info\"> <div x-data=\"cursorWrapper(\'Explore\', \'small\', \'\')\" class=\"cursor-wrapper astro-k4l2zxel\" x-bind:class=\"{\'cursor-wrapper--scrolling\': isScrolling}\"> <div class=\"card__frame card-info__frame\"> <div class=\"card__background\"> <picture> <source srcset=\"https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_720/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 720w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_680/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 680w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_640/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 640w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_580/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 580w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_520/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 520w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_460/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 460w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_450/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 450w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_340/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 340w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_260/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.webp 260w\" type=\"image/webp\"> <source srcset=\"https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_720/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 720w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_680/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 680w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_640/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 640w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_580/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 580w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_520/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 520w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_460/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 460w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_450/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 450w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_340/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 340w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_260/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg 260w\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <img class=\"card__media\" src=\"https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_460/v1705630596/cruiseArea/Svalbard/jbbjr3h61ig8jo3ygmwc.jpg\" alt=\"Adventures In The Arctic\" width=\"460\"> </source></source></picture> </div> <div class=\"card__cover card-info__cover aspect-4/5 md:aspect-3/2\" lang=\"de\"> <p class=\"card-info__subheading type-subtitle\">9 Days</p> <h3 class=\"card-info__heading type-h3\">Adventures In The Arctic</h3> <p class=\"card-info__copy\">Longyearbyen to Longyearbyen, Svalbard. Not as cold in summer as you might expect, these islands have a rugged beauty and offer unforgettable wildlife encounters.</p> <span class=\"card-info__linkText ui-link type-subtitle ui-link--size-large ui-link--type-white astro-7qpaljxn\"> <span class=\"ui-link__box astro-7qpaljxn\"> <span class=\"ui-link__text astro-7qpaljxn\" data-replace=\"Read More\"> Read More </span> </span> </span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </a> </div><div class=\"carousel-card__slide astro-4dlp7wvt\"> <a class=\"card-wrapper\" href=\"/yacht-charter/itinerary/bahamas-cruising-guide\" target=\"_self\" aria-label=\"Explore\"> <div class=\"card card-info\" data-test-id=\"card-info\"> <div x-data=\"cursorWrapper(\'Explore\', \'small\', \'\')\" class=\"cursor-wrapper astro-k4l2zxel\" x-bind:class=\"{\'cursor-wrapper--scrolling\': isScrolling}\"> <div class=\"card__frame card-info__frame\"> <div class=\"card__background\"> <picture> <source srcset=\"https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_720/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirlb0tyl1uklbdd6h.webp 720w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_680/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirlb0tyl1uklbdd6h.webp 680w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_640/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirlb0tyl1uklbdd6h.webp 640w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_580/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirlb0tyl1uklbdd6h.webp 580w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_520/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirlb0tyl1uklbdd6h.webp 520w, https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_460/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirl