mg class=\"card__media\" src=\"https://cdn-image.y.co/upload/f_auto,q_70,c_fill,w_460/v1705476923/itinerary/Bahamas-It%27s-Better-in-the-Bahamas-LYNK-USE-ONLY/wfoirlb0tyl1uklbdd6h.jpg\" alt=\"Escape from the world\" width=\"460\"> </source></source></picture> </div> <div class=\"card__cover card-info__cover aspect-4/5 md:aspect-3/2\" lang=\"de\"> <p class=\"card-info__subheading type-subtitle\">7 Days</p> <h4 class=\"card-info__heading type-h3\">Escape from the world</h4> <p class=\"card-info__copy\">Hawksbill Cay to Crooked Island. Party on a private island. Snorkel amongst Kaleidoscopic corals. Play with sharks. Swim with Pigs. Expect the unexpected.</p> <span class=\"card-info__linkText ui-link type-subtitle ui-link--size-large ui-link--type-white astro-7qpaljxn\"> <span class=\"ui-link__box astro-7qpaljxn\"> <span class=\"ui-link__text astro-7qpaljxn\" data-replace=\"Explore\"> Explore </span> </span> </span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </a> </div> </div> <button type=\"button\" class=\"carousel-card__arrow carousel-card__arrow--prev astro-4dlp7wvt\"> <div x-data=\"cursorWrapper(\'prev\', \'small\', \'arrow-left\')\" class=\"cursor-wrapper carousel-card__cursor astro-4dlp7wvt astro-k4l2zxel\" x-bind:class=\"{\'cursor-wrapper--scrolling\': isScrolling}\"> <span class=\"sr-only astro-4dlp7wvt\">Previous slide</span> </div> </button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"carousel-card__arrow carousel-card__arrow--next astro-4dlp7wvt\"> <div x-data=\"cursorWrapper(\'next\', \'small\', \'arrow-right\')\" class=\"cursor-wrapper carousel-card__cursor astro-4dlp7wvt astro-k4l2zxel\" x-bind:class=\"{\'cursor-wrapper--scrolling\': isScrolling}\"> <span class=\"sr-only astro-4dlp7wvt\">Next slide</span> </div> </button> </div> </div> <footer class=\"section-carousel__bottom wrapper astro-5zey3eax\"> </footer> </div> <section class=\"section-feature-wrapper section--bts section--has-theme section--full-bleed astro-6jxnq6ow\"> <div class=\"section-feature hero hero--theme-dark ast